.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Schrodinger&#x27;s first 1926 paper solved his wave equation for the hydrogen atom and recovered the Bohr energies E_n\propto-1/n^2 without any quantization postulate. HydrogenLikeAtom reproduces the textbook 13.6 eV hydrogen ground-state energy exactly, and its radial wavefunctions (built from the associated Laguerre polynomials of scipy.special) are independently checked here by numerically integrating them to a normalized probability of 1.">

